        "content": {
            "doc-1767286136517": {
                "id": "doc-1767286136517",
                "title": "شرح التركيب",
                "body": "\n        <!-- NEW: Critical Backup Warning -->\n        <div class=\"glass-panel border-r-4 border-yellow-500 rounded-2xl p-0 mb-12 overflow-hidden relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 warning-stripe opacity-30 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 relative z-10\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6\">\n                    <div class=\"flex-shrink-0\">\n                        <div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-yellow-500/20 text-yellow-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border border-yellow-500/30 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(234,179,8,0.2)]\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"alert-triangle\" class=\"w-8 h-8\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            خطوة أمان إجبارية: النسخ الاحتياطي\n                            <span class=\"text-xs bg-yellow-500/20 text-yellow-400 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-yellow-500/20\">هام جداً</span>\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">\n                            قبل البدء في أي عملية تعديل أو تنظيف للكود، <b class=\"text-white\">يجب عليك حفظ نسخة من قالبك الحالي</b>. هذا الإجراء يحميك من فقدان أي أدوات أو أكواد مهمة قد تحتاج للرجوع إليها لاحقاً.\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"bg-black/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-white/5\">\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-yellow-200/90 font-bold mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                <i data-lucide=\"download\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n                                طريقة أخذ النسخة الاحتياطية:\n                            </p>\n                            <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside text-sm text-gray-400 space-y-2 marker:text-yellow-500/50\">\n                                <li>توجه إلى لوحة تحكم بلوجر &larr; <span class=\"text-gray-200\">المظهر (Theme)</span>.</li>\n                                <li>اضغط على السهم الصغير الموجود بجانب زر \"تخصيص\".</li>\n                                <li>اختر <span class=\"text-gray-200\">الاحتفاظ بنسخة احتياطية (Backup)</span> من القائمة.</li>\n                                <li>اضغط على زر <span class=\"text-white bg-blue-600/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs border border-blue-500/30\">تنزيل (Download)</span> لحفظ ملف .xml على جهازك.</li>\n                            </ol>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Step 1: Cleaning Code -->\n        <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 mb-12 relative overflow-hidden group\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-bl-full -mr-8 -mt-8 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110\"></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-8\">\n                    <span class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl border border-blue-500/20\">1</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white\">تنظيف القالب القديم</h2>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Visual Breadcrumb Steps -->\n                <div class=\"bg-black/20 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 mb-8\">\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4 font-bold\">مسار الوصول:</p>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-3 md:gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-white/5 hover:border-blue-500/30 transition\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"layout-dashboard\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-300\"></i>\n                            <span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-200\">لوحة التحكم</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <i data-lucide=\"chevron-left\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-600 arrow-flow\"></i>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-white/5 hover:border-blue-500/30 transition\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"palette\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-pink-400\"></i>\n                            <span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-200\">المظهر</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <i data-lucide=\"chevron-left\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-600 arrow-flow\"></i>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-blue-600/20 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-blue-500/50 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(37,99,235,0.2)]\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"code-2\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-400\"></i>\n                            <span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-blue-100\">تعديل HTML</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Detailed Cleaning Instructions -->\n                <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-blue-300 font-bold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"trash-2\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i> طريقة الحذف الصحيحة\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">\n                            داخل محرر الأكواد، اضغط بداخل المربع ثم استخدم اختصار الكيبورد \n                            <kbd class=\"bg-gray-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-white font-mono text-xs mx-1\">Ctrl + A</kbd>\n                            لتحديد كل شيء، ثم اضغط \n                            <kbd class=\"bg-gray-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-white font-mono text-xs mx-1\">Delete</kbd>.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-green-300 font-bold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"clipboard-paste\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i> الخطوة التالية\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">\n                            بعد أن يصبح المربع فارغاً تماماً، انسخ \"كود التنظيف\" الموجود بالأسفل والصقه مكانه، ثم اضغط حفظ.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Code Block -->\n                <div class=\"relative bg-[#0b1120] rounded-xl border border-white/10 overflow-hidden shadow-inner\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center px-4 py-2 bg-white/5 border-b border-white/5\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 font-mono\">clean_code.xml</span>\n                        <button onclick=\"copyToClipboard('cleanCode')\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-blue-400 hover:text-white transition\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"copy\" class=\"w-3 h-3\"></i> نسخ\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <pre id=\"cleanCode\" class=\"p-4 text-sm font-mono text-green-400 overflow-x-auto selection:bg-green-900/50\">&lt;?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\" ?&gt;\n&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html b:css='false' b:responsive='true' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml' \nxmlns:b='http://www.google.com/2005/gml/b' \nxmlns:data='http://www.google.com/2005/gml/data' \nxmlns:expr='http://www.google.com/2005/gml/expr'&gt;\n&lt;head&gt;&lt;title&gt;Cleaning...&lt;/title&gt;&lt;b:skin&gt;&lt;![CDATA[]]&gt;&lt;/b:skin&gt;&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;&lt;b:section id='main'/&gt;&lt;b:section id='sidebar'/&gt;&lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;</pre>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Step 2: Install Template -->\n        <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 mb-12 relative overflow-hidden group\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-purple-500/10 rounded-bl-full -mr-8 -mt-8 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110\"></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6\">\n                <span class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl border border-purple-500/20\">2</span>\n                <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white\">تركيب القالب الجديد</h2>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-xl border border-white/5\">\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-1\">1</div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-white\">فتح ملف القالب</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">افتح الملف الذي قمت بتحميله (ينتهي بـ .xml) باستخدام أي محرر نصوص مثل Notepad أو VS Code.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-xl border border-white/5\">\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-1\">2</div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-white\">نسخ ولصق</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">انسخ الكود بالكامل، عد إلى بلوجر (مكان كود التنظيف)، امسح كود التنظيف، والصق كود القالب الجديد.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 p-4 rounded-xl mt-4\">\n                    <h4 class=\"text-red-300 font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"x-circle\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i> مشكلة شائعة:\n                    </h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-red-100/70\">\n                        إذا ظهر لك خطأ أثناء الحفظ (مثل خطأ XML)، فهذا يعني غالباً أن النسخ لم يكن مكتملاً. تأكد من نسخ الملف من أول سطر إلى آخر سطر.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Step 3: Activation -->\n        <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 mb-12 relative overflow-hidden border-blue-500/30 shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(37,99,235,0.1)]\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-600/5 to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"text-center relative z-10\">\n                <div class=\"w-20 h-20 mx-auto bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-500 to-indigo-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-xl shadow-blue-600/20 animate-pulse\">\n                    <i data-lucide=\"shield-check\" class=\"w-10 h-10 text-white\"></i>\n                </div>\n                \n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">تفعيل نسخة القالب</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-300 mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto\">\n                    لضمان عمل جميع خصائص القالب (مثل الوضع الليلي، القوائم المنزلقة، والذكاء الاصطناعي)، يجب ربط المدونة بنظام الترخيص.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex justify-center\">\n                    <button onclick=\"switchView('client-area')\" class=\"nav-link flex items-center gap-3 text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-blue-700 hover:to-indigo-700 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-2xl transition-all shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/30 hover:shadow-blue-500/50 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 font-bold cursor-pointer group\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"user-circle\" class=\"w-6 h-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"></i>\n                        <span class=\"font-bold text-lg\">منطقة العملاء</span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Step 4: Post Installation Settings (New Section) -->\n        <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 mb-12 relative overflow-hidden group\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-pink-500/10 rounded-bl-full -mr-8 -mt-8 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110\"></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-8\">\n                <span class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-pink-500/20 text-pink-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl border border-pink-500/20\">3</span>\n                <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white\">إعدادات ما بعد التركيب</h2>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                <!-- Setting Card 1 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-pink-500/30 transition duration-300\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-pink-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-pink-400 mb-4\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"image\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2\">ضبط اللوجو (الشعار)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside\">\n                        <li>اذهب إلى <b>التنسيق</b> > ابحث عن أداة <b>Header Logo</b>.</li>\n                        <li>ارفع صورتك (يفضل SVG أو PNG شفافة).</li>\n                        <li>اختر الخيار \"بدلاً من العنوان والوصف\".</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Setting Card 2 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-pink-500/30 transition duration-300\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-pink-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-pink-400 mb-4\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"menu\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2\">القائمة الرئيسية</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside\">\n                        <li>في <b>التنسيق</b>، ابحث عن <b>Main Menu</b>.</li>\n                        <li>استخدم زر \"إضافة عنصر جديد\" لإضافة الأقسام.</li>\n                        <li>لإنشاء قائمة منسدلة، ابدأ اسم العنصر بـ <code class=\"bg-black/30 px-1 rounded text-xs\">_</code> (مثال: _أخبار).</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Setting Card 3 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-pink-500/30 transition duration-300\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-pink-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-pink-400 mb-4\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"globe\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2\">أيقونة الموقع (Favicon)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside\">\n                        <li>في أعلى صفحة التنسيق، اضغط \"أيقونة التفضيلات\".</li>\n                        <li>ارفع صورة مربعة (يفضل 100kb أو أقل).</li>\n                        <li>ستظهر هذه الأيقونة في تبويب المتصفح.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Setting Card 4 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-pink-500/30 transition duration-300\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-pink-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-pink-400 mb-4\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"smartphone\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2\">القائمة السفلية للجوال</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside\">\n                        <li>في التنسيق، ابحث عن <b>Mobile Bottom Menu</b>.</li>\n                        <li>يمكنك تغيير الأيقونات باستخدام أسماء أيقونات SVG.</li>\n                        <li>تأكد من عدم وضع أكثر من 5 عناصر لضمان الشكل الجمالي.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n"
            },
            "doc-1767287681867": {
                "id": "doc-1767287681867",
                "title": "إعدادات الهيدر والقوائم",
                "body": "\n    <!-- Config -->\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        cairo: ['Cairo', 'sans-serif'],\n                        mono: ['Fira Code', 'monospace'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        glass: {\n                            surface: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)',\n                            border: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15)',\n                            highlight: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)',\n                        }\n                    },\n                    animation: {\n                        'blob': 'blob 7s infinite',\n                        'float': 'float 6s ease-in-out infinite',\n                    },\n                    keyframes: {\n                        blob: {\n                            '0%': { transform: 'translate(0px, 0px) scale(1)' },\n                            '33%': { transform: 'translate(30px, -50px) scale(1.1)' },\n                            '66%': { transform: 'translate(-20px, 20px) scale(0.9)' },\n                            '100%': { transform: 'translate(0px, 0px) scale(1)' },\n                        },\n                        float: {\n                            '0%, 100%': { transform: 'translateY(0)' },\n                            '50%': { transform: 'translateY(-10px)' },\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Custom Scrollbar */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #0f172a; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #6366f1; border-radius: 4px; }\n        \n        /* Advanced Glass Effect */\n        .glass-card {\n            background: rgba(17, 25, 40, 0.7);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.125);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n        }\n        \n        .glass-panel {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .glass-panel:hover {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n        }\n\n        /* Syntax Highlighting Style */\n        .code-block {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\n            background: #0d1117;\n            border: 1px solid #30363d;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            color: #e6edf3;\n        }\n        .token-keyword { color: #ff7b72; }\n        .token-string { color: #a5d6ff; }\n        .token-tag { color: #7ee787; }\n        \n        /* Custom Step Line */\n        .step-connector::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            right: 1.25rem; /* Center of the icon */\n            height: 100%;\n            width: 2px;\n            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #6366f1, transparent);\n            z-index: 0;\n        }\n    </style>\n\n        <!-- Section 1: Header Styles (With Steps) -->\n        <section class=\"glass-card rounded-3xl p-8 overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-8\">\n                <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 text-blue-400\">\n                    <i data-lucide=\"palette\" class=\"w-6 h-6\"></i>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white\">1. أشكال الهيدر (Header Styles)</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm\">اختر التصميم الذي يناسب هوية موقعك</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10\">\n                <!-- Steps Visual -->\n                <div class=\"relative step-connector space-y-8 pr-2\">\n                    <!-- Step 1 -->\n                    <div class=\"relative flex gap-6 z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border-2 border-indigo-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20\">\n                            <span class=\"font-mono font-bold text-indigo-400\">1</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"glass-panel p-4 rounded-xl flex-1\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-bold text-indigo-200 mb-1\">لوحة التحكم</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">انتقل إلى علامة التبويب <b>\"التخطيط\" (Layout)</b> في بلوجر.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Step 2 -->\n                    <div class=\"relative flex gap-6 z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border-2 border-indigo-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20\">\n                            <span class=\"font-mono font-bold text-indigo-400\">2</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"glass-panel p-4 rounded-xl flex-1\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-bold text-indigo-200 mb-1\">ابحث عن الأداة</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">ستجد أداة باسم <b>\"إعدادات الهيدر\"</b> أو <b>\"Header Options\"</b>.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Step 3 -->\n                    <div class=\"relative flex gap-6 z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border-2 border-indigo-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20\">\n                            <span class=\"font-mono font-bold text-indigo-400\">3</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"glass-panel p-4 rounded-xl flex-1 border-indigo-500/30\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                <i data-lucide=\"edit-3\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400\"></i>\n                                التعديل\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 mb-3\">\n                                ستجد رابطاً باسم <span class=\"code-block text-xs\">style</span>، قم بتغيير <b>رابط الموقع (URL)</b> لأحد الأرقام التالية:\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Preview Grid -->\n                <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\">معاينة الأشكال</h3>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"glass-panel p-4 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-4 hover:border-slate-400/50 cursor-pointer group\">\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-slate-700/50 flex items-center justify-center border border-slate-600 font-mono text-xl group-hover:bg-slate-600 transition-colors\">0</div>\n                        <div>\n                            <strong class=\"block text-white\">الوضع الافتراضي</strong>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">تصميم كلاسيكي مع خلفية متدرجة (موجي).</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"glass-panel p-4 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-4 hover:border-red-400/50 cursor-pointer group\">\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-red-900/20 flex items-center justify-center border border-red-500/30 font-mono text-xl text-red-400 group-hover:bg-red-900/40 transition-colors\">1</div>\n                        <div>\n                            <strong class=\"block text-red-100\">التصميم الإخباري</strong>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-red-200/60\">شريط أحمر علوي، مناسب للمجلات والمواقع الإخبارية.</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"glass-panel p-4 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-4 hover:border-sky-400/50 cursor-pointer group\">\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-sky-900/20 flex items-center justify-center border border-sky-500/30 font-mono text-xl text-sky-400 group-hover:bg-sky-900/40 transition-colors\">2</div>\n                        <div>\n                            <strong class=\"block text-sky-100\">التصميم التقني</strong>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-sky-200/60\">ألوان زرقاء وكحلية، مناسب للمدونات التقنية.</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Section 2: Menu System -->\n        <section class=\"glass-card rounded-3xl p-8\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-8 border-b border-glass-border pb-6\">\n                <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400\">\n                    <i data-lucide=\"menu\" class=\"w-6 h-6\"></i>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white\">2. نظام القوائم (Menu System)</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm\">كيفية إنشاء قوائم منسدلة وميجا منيو</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n                <!-- Dropdown Card -->\n                <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-all\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"chevron-down-circle\" class=\"w-24 h-24 text-emerald-500\"></i>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-emerald-300 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"list-tree\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n                        القائمة المنسدلة\n                    </h3>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n                            لإنشاء قائمة فرعية، أضف رمز الشرطة السفلية <span class=\"code-block text-emerald-400\">_</span> في بداية اسم الرابط.\n                        </p>\n\n                        <!-- Code Example -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#0f1219] rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/5 font-mono text-sm shadow-inner\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-500 mb-2 text-xs border-b border-white/5 pb-2\">\n                                <i data-lucide=\"settings-2\" class=\"w-3 h-3\"></i>\n                                <span>Link List Widget</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n                                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-slate-300\">\n                                    <span>الرئيسية</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-600\">/</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-slate-300\">\n                                    <span>أقسام الموقع</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-600\">#</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-emerald-400 pl-4 border-r-2 border-emerald-500/30 mr-1 bg-emerald-900/10 rounded-l\">\n                                    <span><span class=\"text-yellow-500\">_</span>تطبيقات</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-600\">/apps</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-emerald-400 pl-4 border-r-2 border-emerald-500/30 mr-1 bg-emerald-900/10 rounded-l\">\n                                    <span><span class=\"text-yellow-500\">_</span>ألعاب</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-600\">/games</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Mega Menu Card -->\n                <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-pink-500/30 transition-all\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"grid\" class=\"w-24 h-24 text-pink-500\"></i>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-pink-300 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"layers\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n                        الميجا منيو (Mega Menu)\n                    </h3>\n\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n                            تعرض آخر المقالات مع الصور المصغرة. استخدم الكود القصير <span class=\"code-block text-pink-400\">[mega]</span>.\n                        </p>\n\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#0f1219] rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/5 font-mono text-sm shadow-inner\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-500 mb-2 text-xs border-b border-white/5 pb-2\">\n                                <i data-lucide=\"plus-circle\" class=\"w-3 h-3\"></i>\n                                <span>Add New Item</span>\n                            </div>\n                            \n                            <!-- Input Simulation -->\n                            <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <label class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 block mb-1\">New Site Name</label>\n                                    <div class=\"text-pink-400 bg-slate-800/50 p-2 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n                                        <span class=\"text-yellow-500\">[mega]</span>\n                                        <span class=\"text-white\">تكنولوجيا</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <label class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 block mb-1\">New Site URL</label>\n                                    <div class=\"text-slate-400 bg-slate-800/50 p-2 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n                                        /search/label/تكنولوجيا\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-pink-300/80 bg-pink-900/20 p-2 rounded border border-pink-500/10\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"alert-circle\" class=\"w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"></i>\n                            <p>هام: يجب أن تكون الكلمة بعد [mega] مطابقة تماماً لاسم القسم (التسمية) في مقالاتك.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Section 3: News Ticker -->\n        <section class=\"glass-card rounded-3xl p-8\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6\">\n                <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 text-red-400\">\n                    <i data-lucide=\"rss\" class=\"w-6 h-6\"></i>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white\">3. شريط الأخبار (Ticker)</h2>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-glass-border bg-glass-surface\">\n                <table class=\"w-full text-right border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-white/5 text-slate-300 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider\">\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border-b border-glass-border font-semibold\">العنصر (Name)</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border-b border-glass-border font-semibold\">القيمة المقترحة</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border-b border-glass-border font-semibold\">شرح الوظيفة</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-white/5 text-sm\">\n                        <tr class=\"group hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 font-mono text-yellow-400\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                    <i data-lucide=\"code\" class=\"w-3 h-3 opacity-50\"></i> style\n                                </div>\n                            </td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 text-white font-medium\">1 - 5</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 text-slate-400\">\n                                شكل الشريط. <span class=\"text-indigo-300\">1</span> بسيط، <span class=\"text-indigo-300\">2</span> تقني، <span class=\"text-indigo-300\">4</span> زجاجي.\n                            </td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"group hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 font-mono text-yellow-400\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                    <i data-lucide=\"type\" class=\"w-3 h-3 opacity-50\"></i> title\n                                </div>\n                            </td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 text-white font-medium\">\"عاجل\" أو \"جديدنا\"</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 text-slate-400\">النص الذي يظهر في المربع الملون بداية الشريط.</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"group hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 font-mono text-yellow-400\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                    <i data-lucide=\"hash\" class=\"w-3 h-3 opacity-50\"></i> count\n                                </div>\n                            </td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 text-white font-medium\">5</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 text-slate-400\">عدد المشاركات التي سيتم جلبها وعرضها في الشريط.</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Footer Navigation -->\n        <div class=\"flex justify-center mt-12\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"group relative px-8 py-4 bg-indigo-600 rounded-full overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-indigo-500/30 hover:shadow-indigo-500/50 transition-all duration-300\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent translate-x-[-100%] group-hover:translate-x-[100%] transition-transform duration-700\"></div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 relative z-10 text-white font-bold\">\n                    <span>الانتقال للدرس التالي: الصفحة الرئيسية</span>\n                    <i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" class=\"w-5 h-5 group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform\"></i>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n"
            }
        }
    }
]
